#: 42b19c2131884537afd9296475bdaa20
msgid "MiniPix voltage and current sensing pins use Pixhawk standard ( :ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 2, :ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 3). The additional ADC pin can be used for either RSSI or analog airspeed. Set required option to PIN = 11."
msgstr ""
